  "fields": {
    "title": "Font",
    "textContent": {
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Description",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "heading-3"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "The @font-face property enables you to embed your own fonts into your website, without being limited to the so-called \"web-safe\" fonts (the fonts which are so common that they're considered to be universally available, e.g. Arial or Times New Roman). ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "You can embed fonts by storing them inside your website folder. We recommend creating a separate folder especially for these font files. Your font file can then be loaded into ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "3TBGoqMl1snjRBxLIzrc6Z",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "CSS",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " via ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "value": "font: url",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " within the @font-face property. You can also import fonts without embedding the font file, like ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://fonts.google.com/"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "Google Fonts",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": ".",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "If you notice, that your embedded font is displayed slightly heavier in weight than the font style actually is, try adjusting ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "2uqMgKXjERU9cs9qR8E0Tp",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "font-smoothing",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": ".",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Possibilities",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "heading-3"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "You can not only embed static fonts, but also ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "1dmTPt3ONqIzoLPuoDUMuT",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "variable fonts",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": ". Variable fonts are very useful because only one font file has to be loaded, not several font files for different cuts as is the case with static fonts. ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Saw a website using a cool font and wann now which font this was? No problem, try inspecting the website with the ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "3kpgl4hPVcbTfdNGnwPfUJ",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "developer tools",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " and you will probably find out.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": "document"
    },
    "codeField": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "css\n@font-face {\n  font-family: \"ABC Favorit\";\n  src: url(\"/fonts/ABCFavorit-Regular.woff2\") format(\"woff2\"),\n       url(\"/fonts/ABCFavorit-Regular.woff\") format(\"woff\");\n}",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
